    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frontline Protocol</strong> is an <strong>RTS</strong> with <strong>deckbuilding</strong> and <strong>auto battler</strong> elements, entirely focused on <strong>cooperative PvE</strong>. It features a tactically rich card system: you draw from three customizable decks at once, rewarding specialization, deck planning, and player experience, allowing you to control each frontline with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether solo or in <strong>online co-op with up to three players</strong>, each battle brings new challenges. You share <strong>resources</strong>, <strong>spawners</strong>, and <strong>eco buildings</strong>. Your deck composition lets you focus on specific roles - such as <strong>economy</strong>, <strong>defense</strong>, <strong>support</strong>, or <strong>aggressive frontline control</strong> using light infantry. <strong>Communication</strong> and <strong>timing</strong> are crucial, as whatever one player builds benefits the whole team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you earn <strong>booster credits</strong> that can be spent on new <strong>card packs</strong>. These packs include new cards, temporary bonuses, and resources to further develop your decks. Some cards can also be <strong>upgraded</strong>, permanently lowering their deployment cost\u2014offering long-term depth over short-term optimization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each <strong>level-up</strong>, you gain a <strong>skill point</strong> to invest in passive bonuses\u2014such as higher starting resources, larger hand size, or better resource rates. This adds a growing <strong>meta-progression system</strong> that deepens your playstyle alongside your deck choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experienced players can take on <strong>missions</strong>, randomly generated mini-campaigns with special challenges. Completing them earns <strong>mission coins</strong> used to unlock <strong>special booster packs</strong>. These contain unique <strong>deployment plans</strong>, <strong>booster items</strong>, and additional rewards that can be strategically used to optimize your loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over <strong>300 cards</strong> for <strong>units</strong>, <strong>buildings</strong>, <strong>towers</strong>, and <strong>special actions</strong>, you'll find the playstyle that suits you best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/6611659718f3f1d2ef935ea3ee596747.poster.avif?t=1751444811\" width=500 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/6611659718f3f1d2ef935ea3ee596747.webm?t=1751444811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/18943cd46debf5289f836367c0221fb4.poster.avif?t=1751444811\" width=500 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/18943cd46debf5289f836367c0221fb4.webm?t=1751444811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frontline Protocol</strong> is an <strong>RTS</strong> with <strong>deckbuilding</strong> and <strong>auto battler</strong> elements, entirely focused on <strong>cooperative PvE</strong>. It features a tactically rich card system: you draw from three customizable decks at once, rewarding specialization, deck planning, and player experience, allowing you to control each frontline with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether solo or in <strong>online co-op with up to three players</strong>, each battle brings new challenges. You share <strong>resources</strong>, <strong>spawners</strong>, and <strong>eco buildings</strong>. Your deck composition lets you focus on specific roles - such as <strong>economy</strong>, <strong>defense</strong>, <strong>support</strong>, or <strong>aggressive frontline control</strong> using light infantry. <strong>Communication</strong> and <strong>timing</strong> are crucial, as whatever one player builds benefits the whole team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you earn <strong>booster credits</strong> that can be spent on new <strong>card packs</strong>. These packs include new cards, temporary bonuses, and resources to further develop your decks. Some cards can also be <strong>upgraded</strong>, permanently lowering their deployment cost\u2014offering long-term depth over short-term optimization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each <strong>level-up</strong>, you gain a <strong>skill point</strong> to invest in passive bonuses\u2014such as higher starting resources, larger hand size, or better resource rates. This adds a growing <strong>meta-progression system</strong> that deepens your playstyle alongside your deck choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experienced players can take on <strong>missions</strong>, randomly generated mini-campaigns with special challenges. Completing them earns <strong>mission coins</strong> used to unlock <strong>special booster packs</strong>. These contain unique <strong>deployment plans</strong>, <strong>booster items</strong>, and additional rewards that can be strategically used to optimize your loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over <strong>300 cards</strong> for <strong>units</strong>, <strong>buildings</strong>, <strong>towers</strong>, and <strong>special actions</strong>, you'll find the playstyle that suits you best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/6611659718f3f1d2ef935ea3ee596747.poster.avif?t=1751444811\" width=500 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/6611659718f3f1d2ef935ea3ee596747.webm?t=1751444811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/18943cd46debf5289f836367c0221fb4.poster.avif?t=1751444811\" width=500 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3288450/extras/18943cd46debf5289f836367c0221fb4.webm?t=1751444811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Frontline Protocol is a combination of RTS, deckbuilder, and auto battler. Play cards and deploy units, expand your economy or use action cards to conquer one base after another. Level up, unlock new cards, and invest in your meta progression.",
